WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.600 --> 00:06.000
National Radio and Television Administration

3
01:25.000 --> 01:30.000
[Welcome to Sister Pang's Bathhouse]

4
02:00.480 --> 02:02.000
Isn't there a surveillance camera?

5
02:02.000 --> 02:03.160
If we pull up the footage from that day,

6
02:03.160 --> 02:04.620
we'll know what happened.

7
02:05.320 --> 02:06.000
Uncle.

8
02:06.600 --> 02:07.560
This is a murder case.

9
02:07.560 --> 02:08.560
The police have already taken the videos

10
02:08.560 --> 02:10.560
from before and after the incident.

11
02:28.520 --> 02:30.120
I've always felt that

12
02:31.440 --> 02:35.300
it was only a matter of time before someone like my brother got killed.

13
02:37.320 --> 02:38.450
I just didn't expect

14
02:40.320 --> 02:43.040
that he would actually end up like this.

15
02:43.600 --> 02:44.960
Don't be too sad.

16
02:47.680 --> 02:48.840
Why would I be sad?

17
02:51.960 --> 02:53.420
Ever since I can remember,

18
02:55.560 --> 02:58.840
my dad would beat my brother whenever he was upset.

19
02:59.120 --> 03:00.840
And my brother was so stubborn,

20
03:00.840 --> 03:03.120
he never knew how to beg for mercy.

21
03:03.400 --> 03:06.120
I don't know where he got such a temper.

22
03:06.120 --> 03:06.650
You know,

23
03:06.880 --> 03:09.120
he was always getting into fights outside

24
03:09.120 --> 03:10.250
and never came home.

25
03:10.960 --> 03:14.020
In the end, he started going to jail time and time again.

26
03:14.760 --> 03:17.490
The villagers never stopped gossiping about it.

27
03:18.920 --> 03:21.780
It made our whole family unable to hold our heads up.

28
03:22.840 --> 03:24.560
The last time he was in prison,

29
03:25.480 --> 03:27.040
my mom died of an illness.

30
03:28.720 --> 03:31.079
She died calling his name.

31
03:32.960 --> 03:34.360
Even when the old lady was dying,

32
03:34.360 --> 03:36.490
she couldn't stop worrying about him.

33
03:37.360 --> 03:39.840
Since then, my dad stopped contacting him

34
03:40.079 --> 03:43.079
and even moved us away on purpose.

35
03:43.480 --> 03:44.079
Well...

36
03:44.360 --> 03:45.760
I... I want this money,

37
03:45.760 --> 03:47.240
but not for myself.

38
03:47.960 --> 03:50.840
You see, my dad is getting old

39
03:50.840 --> 03:52.100
and his health is poor.

40
03:52.240 --> 03:55.240
The house needs to be repaired too.

41
03:58.680 --> 03:59.520
This money,

42
04:03.360 --> 04:06.490
just consider it my brother fulfilling his filial duty.

43
04:09.960 --> 04:10.760
I understand.

44
04:11.800 --> 04:13.460
Anyway, regarding the money,

45
04:13.880 --> 04:17.240
I will definitely try my best to fight for it.

46
04:18.800 --> 04:19.459
Brother Hu,

47
04:20.040 --> 04:21.970
come with me on a field assignment.

48
04:23.600 --> 04:25.080
Didn't you say we can't review the files?

49
04:25.080 --> 04:27.400
Then how do you know where the murderer lives?

50
04:27.400 --> 04:30.280
The cause, process, and related evidence of the case

51
04:30.280 --> 04:31.880
cannot be reviewed right now.

52
04:31.880 --> 04:33.800
But the personal information of the parties involved

53
04:33.800 --> 04:35.360
can still be found.

54
04:45.800 --> 04:46.440
Hello.

55
04:50.760 --> 04:52.159
Hello. Is anyone there?

56
04:52.920 --> 04:53.850
What do you want?

57
04:53.960 --> 04:54.320
Hello.

58
04:54.320 --> 04:57.080
We are looking for Fu Xiaochen's relatives.

59
05:00.680 --> 05:02.200
Who are you?

60
05:14.200 --> 05:15.000
Have some water, comrades.

61
05:15.000 --> 05:15.600
Thank you.

62
05:16.600 --> 05:17.080
Thank you.

63
05:17.080 --> 05:18.010
Have some water.

64
05:22.320 --> 05:23.320
It's fine.

65
05:23.440 --> 05:25.320
The old man is hard of hearing.

66
05:26.200 --> 05:26.800
Lawyer.

67
05:26.800 --> 05:28.920
You see, we went out to work before.

68
05:29.000 --> 05:33.040
We got a little work injury and can't do heavy labor anymore.

69
05:33.320 --> 05:34.760
The old man is getting old,

70
05:34.760 --> 05:36.620
so we came back to take care of him.

71
05:37.159 --> 05:38.800
We didn't make any money,

72
05:40.320 --> 05:42.200
and we didn't raise our child well either.

73
05:42.200 --> 05:43.200
Our Xiaochen,

74
05:43.880 --> 05:45.720
although his grades were not good,

75
05:45.720 --> 05:47.920
he is a very honest child.

76
05:48.280 --> 05:50.120
He is also filial to his grandmother.

77
05:50.120 --> 05:51.200
After graduating from technical school,

78
05:51.200 --> 05:53.659
he worked on a construction site in the city.

79
05:53.680 --> 05:56.200
He even sent money back to us.

80
05:56.760 --> 06:01.440
A child like him who hasn't even killed a chicken or a duck,

81
06:02.160 --> 06:04.490
how could he get into this kind of trouble?

82
06:04.960 --> 06:07.640
Lawyer, I know you must pay a life for a life.

83
06:07.920 --> 06:11.120
Will my son be

84
06:13.200 --> 06:14.520
executed?

85
06:19.680 --> 06:21.000
I can't say for sure.

86
06:21.200 --> 06:22.200
I came here today

87
06:22.200 --> 06:24.120
to represent the victim's family.

88
06:24.120 --> 06:25.640
Let's talk about this.

89
06:25.640 --> 06:27.240
What the family means is that

90
06:27.280 --> 06:30.880
if you are willing to pay some compensation,

91
06:30.880 --> 06:33.440
you can get their forgiveness.

92
06:35.120 --> 06:36.120
Forgiveness?

93
06:36.480 --> 06:37.760
It means that

94
06:37.840 --> 06:39.640
after you pay the compensation,

95
06:39.840 --> 06:42.800
you can get a letter of forgiveness from the victim's family.

96
06:42.800 --> 06:44.040
This letter of forgiveness

97
06:44.040 --> 06:45.800
for Xiaochen's sentencing

98
06:45.800 --> 06:46.840
is very important.

99
06:46.840 --> 06:47.400
Well...

100
06:48.800 --> 06:49.960
We are willing to.

101
06:49.960 --> 06:51.040
We are willing to pay.

102
06:51.040 --> 06:51.600
We are willing to pay.

103
06:51.600 --> 06:54.440
Xiaochen's father happens to have some work injury compensation.

104
06:54.440 --> 06:55.840
We are willing to give it.

105
06:55.840 --> 06:57.320
If it's not enough, I'll borrow some.

106
06:57.320 --> 06:58.520
As long as I can save my son,

107
06:58.520 --> 07:00.050
I can even give them my life.

108
07:00.400 --> 07:02.730
Please talk to their family nicely, okay?

109
07:02.840 --> 07:04.160
I beg you, lawyer.

110
07:04.440 --> 07:05.970
Please talk to them nicely.

111
07:08.600 --> 07:10.360
As a serious and rigorous

112
07:10.360 --> 07:11.280
Legal worker.

113
07:11.280 --> 07:13.340
I want to discuss a question with you.

114
07:13.520 --> 07:14.320
Look.

115
07:14.320 --> 07:15.600
Suppose there is a person

116
07:15.600 --> 07:16.600
who is very poor.

117
07:16.800 --> 07:18.480
If he kills someone,

118
07:18.800 --> 07:20.520
he doesn't have the money to pay compensation.

119
07:20.520 --> 07:21.520
Does that mean he can only

120
07:21.520 --> 07:22.680
honestly wait

121
07:22.680 --> 07:23.880
for whatever sentence he gets?

122
07:23.880 --> 07:25.120
On the other hand,

123
07:25.280 --> 07:26.040
suppose there is a person

124
07:26.040 --> 07:27.440
who is not short of money at all.

125
07:27.440 --> 07:29.360
Does that mean he can kill whoever he wants?

126
07:29.360 --> 07:30.720
Anyway, when the time comes,

127
07:30.720 --> 07:32.280
the worst that can happen is he pays compensation

128
07:32.280 --> 07:34.400
and then spends a dozen years in prison.

129
07:34.400 --> 07:35.280
The way this works

130
07:35.280 --> 07:37.080
is like opening a back door for the rich.

131
07:37.080 --> 07:38.810
I think it's extremely unfair.

132
07:40.360 --> 07:41.620
If you think like that,

133
07:41.680 --> 07:43.320
you're being a bit extreme.

134
07:43.320 --> 07:45.680
The circumstances of each case are different.

135
07:45.680 --> 07:49.010
You have to see if the circumstances of the crime are severe,

136
07:49.120 --> 07:50.680
and if its impact is huge.

137
07:50.840 --> 07:51.760
Besides,

138
07:52.000 --> 07:53.840
the purpose of punishment is not

139
07:53.840 --> 07:54.600
to penalize,

140
07:54.640 --> 07:55.880
but to reform.

141
07:56.000 --> 07:58.800
Paying compensation is just one of the ways of repentance

142
07:58.800 --> 08:01.520
recognized by the law.

143
08:01.760 --> 08:03.090
If you don't have money,

144
08:03.120 --> 08:04.440
there are other ways.

145
08:04.560 --> 08:06.000
I get the gist of it.

146
08:06.000 --> 08:07.560
Let's get back to this case.

147
08:07.640 --> 08:09.680
If Fu Xiaochen is really a

148
08:09.680 --> 08:11.760
very obedient and sensible child,

149
08:11.880 --> 08:13.960
and when he encountered that incident,

150
08:13.960 --> 08:15.000
he panicked

151
08:15.360 --> 08:16.840
and took extreme actions,

152
08:17.120 --> 08:18.050
and afterwards,

153
08:18.120 --> 08:19.240
he is willing to repent

154
08:19.240 --> 08:20.500
and pay compensation,

155
08:20.880 --> 08:24.520
then the court can certainly handle it at its discretion.

156
08:26.160 --> 08:27.160
That's not right.

157
08:27.560 --> 08:28.240
Logically speaking,

158
08:28.240 --> 08:30.240
shouldn't you be more familiar with Zhao Deqing?

159
08:30.240 --> 08:31.440
What you're implying

160
08:31.440 --> 08:33.100
is all in favor of Fu Xiaochen.

161
08:35.520 --> 08:36.980
I'm not familiar with him.

162
08:40.320 --> 08:41.049
Understood.

163
08:51.280 --> 08:52.200
It's the middle of the night.

164
08:52.200 --> 08:53.720
Are you trying to scare people by pretending to be a ghost?

165
08:53.720 --> 08:56.320
Did you go talk to someone about compensation?

166
08:56.400 --> 08:57.160
Yes.

167
08:58.080 --> 08:58.720
No.

168
08:59.360 --> 09:01.420
Didn't I introduce Zhao Deyan to you?

169
09:02.600 --> 09:05.330
I'm telling you, Xiaolong. What are you doing...

170
09:07.080 --> 09:08.080
Hello, Ms. Zhao.

171
09:08.560 --> 09:10.800
I've already met Fu Xiaochen's parents.

172
09:10.800 --> 09:13.480
They are quite willing to pay compensation.

173
09:13.480 --> 09:15.760
Anyway, let's find another time to discuss it.

174
09:15.760 --> 09:19.490
Once the amount is confirmed, we can issue a letter of forgiveness.

175
09:21.520 --> 09:22.920
It's the least I could do.

176
09:23.160 --> 09:23.640
Okay.

177
10:09.200 --> 10:10.440
My butt hurts.

178
10:11.000 --> 10:11.760
Brother Jun.

179
10:12.160 --> 10:13.760
This is the first time you're treating me to a meal.

180
10:13.760 --> 10:15.800
Is it okay that we didn't bring Xiao Longnv?

181
10:15.800 --> 10:16.720
I see her every day.

182
10:16.720 --> 10:17.920
Why would I bring her?

183
10:18.640 --> 10:19.280
Okay.

184
10:19.760 --> 10:21.120
As long as you think it's fine.

185
10:21.120 --> 10:22.080
Come on, let's go.

186
10:22.080 --> 10:22.740
Here we are.

187
10:23.360 --> 10:24.920
I was thinking about etiquette

188
10:24.920 --> 10:25.920
and stuff like that.

189
10:25.920 --> 10:26.850
Come on, come on.

190
10:26.880 --> 10:27.520
No, no, you first.

191
10:27.520 --> 10:28.320
Come on, go in.

192
10:28.320 --> 10:29.280
After you. Go in. Please.

193
10:29.280 --> 10:30.520
You're too kind, Brother Jun.

194
10:30.520 --> 10:31.520
Come on, hurry up.

195
10:40.640 --> 10:42.040
No, Brother Jun, this...

196
10:46.400 --> 10:48.120
Brother Jun, what kind of meal is this?

197
10:48.120 --> 10:49.780
Why do we have to lock the door?

198
10:52.520 --> 10:53.440
It's just these guys.

199
10:53.440 --> 10:54.000
I don't need to introduce them.

200
10:54.000 --> 10:55.600
You know who they are, right?

201
10:55.640 --> 10:57.640
Are these the legendary Eight Great Guardians?

202
10:57.640 --> 10:59.280
As long as you behave,

203
10:59.280 --> 11:00.810
I guarantee you'll be fine.

204
11:03.600 --> 11:04.360
Well...

205
11:04.760 --> 11:06.160
Including you, there are only five.

206
11:06.160 --> 11:07.440
Three are missing.

207
11:07.840 --> 11:09.360
Two are dead.

208
11:09.400 --> 11:11.520
And one had a stroke and can't get out of bed.

209
11:11.520 --> 11:13.520
What? Why are you telling him that?

210
11:14.400 --> 11:15.040
Come on.

211
11:15.480 --> 11:16.480
Hurry up and eat.

212
11:16.480 --> 11:17.680
So we can hit the road.

213
11:18.200 --> 11:19.480
No, what road am I hitting?

214
11:19.480 --> 11:20.960
What did I do, Brother Jun?

215
11:21.040 --> 11:21.480
I mean,

216
11:21.480 --> 11:23.940
you'll lead us to Fu Xiaochen's house later.

217
11:24.920 --> 11:27.520
I remember the way to Fu Xiaochen's house.

218
11:27.600 --> 11:30.480
But your daughter, Xiao Longnv, won't allow it.

219
11:34.520 --> 11:36.040
What era is this?

220
11:36.040 --> 11:37.000
Brothers,

221
11:37.280 --> 11:38.160
I've grown up.

222
11:38.160 --> 11:39.040
This doesn't scare me anymore.

223
11:39.040 --> 11:41.240
So you mean you don't want to lead us there?

224
11:41.240 --> 11:41.640
How can I go?

225
11:41.640 --> 11:43.000
If you don't go, I'm telling you,

226
11:43.000 --> 11:44.560
your life won't be peaceful anymore.

227
11:44.560 --> 11:45.760
What else can happen?

228
11:45.880 --> 11:48.680
Fine, I'll rely on you for the rest of my life.

229
11:48.680 --> 11:49.520
No, don't.

230
11:52.720 --> 11:53.800
Okay, okay, I yield.

231
11:53.800 --> 11:54.330
I give up.

232
11:54.360 --> 11:55.360
I give up, okay?

233
11:56.760 --> 11:58.560
Okay, let's eat first.

234
12:10.640 --> 12:11.700
What are you doing?

235
12:12.040 --> 12:13.500
I thought we should all go.

236
12:24.960 --> 12:25.280
What are you doing?

237
12:25.280 --> 12:26.200
Stop right there!

238
12:26.200 --> 12:27.400
I didn't do anything.

239
12:28.520 --> 12:29.200
Where are you going?

240
12:29.200 --> 12:29.760
It's him.

241
12:29.760 --> 12:32.360
He's been sneaking around here for a long time.

242
12:32.760 --> 12:34.480
What are you guys doing?

243
12:34.480 --> 12:35.360
What do you mean sneaking around?

244
12:35.360 --> 12:36.600
I'm tailing someone.

245
12:36.680 --> 12:37.840
Tailing? Tailing who?

246
12:37.840 --> 12:38.900
Explain yourself.

247
12:39.720 --> 12:41.240
You're not leaving until you explain.

248
12:41.240 --> 12:42.320
Explain what?

249
12:42.320 --> 12:43.840
You're even calling for backup.

250
12:43.840 --> 12:45.320
The police will be here soon.

251
12:45.320 --> 12:46.720
I am the police.

252
12:47.080 --> 12:48.610
Is this me? Look, come here.

253
12:51.760 --> 12:53.640
This place looks too fancy.

254
12:54.320 --> 12:56.240
Sir, all your dishes are served. Enjoy your meal.

255
12:56.240 --> 12:56.840
Thank you.

256
12:57.120 --> 12:57.720
Lawyer Li,

257
12:57.880 --> 12:59.400
do you have some good news to announce?

258
12:59.400 --> 13:00.560
Did you take on another big case?

259
13:00.560 --> 13:02.520
What? Can't we eat without taking a case?

260
13:02.520 --> 13:03.120
Come.

261
13:03.520 --> 13:06.120
Thank you all for your recent dedication and hard work.

262
13:06.120 --> 13:07.380
It's nothing. Cheers.

263
13:10.600 --> 13:11.240
Let's eat.

264
13:12.000 --> 13:12.720
I've always hoped

265
13:12.720 --> 13:14.480
that we are a highly efficient team.

266
13:14.480 --> 13:14.880
But...

267
13:17.640 --> 13:18.200
Hello?

268
13:21.560 --> 13:22.200
Okay, I got it.

269
13:22.200 --> 13:23.260
I'll head over now.

270
13:23.360 --> 13:24.080
Listen, you guys eat.

271
13:24.080 --> 13:25.040
I'll go pay the bill.

272
13:25.040 --> 13:25.560
I have an emergency.

273
13:25.560 --> 13:26.320
In such a hurry?

274
13:26.320 --> 13:27.440
Do you need me to go with you?

275
13:27.440 --> 13:28.040
No need.

276
13:32.800 --> 13:35.760
Didn't Lawyer Li say 'but' before he left?

277
13:38.520 --> 13:39.280
I knew it.

278
13:40.360 --> 13:42.120
This meal isn't as easy

279
13:42.120 --> 13:43.000
as it looks.

280
13:43.200 --> 13:44.330
Something's wrong.

281
13:44.360 --> 13:47.120
I heard the firm recently recruited a group of newcomers.

282
13:47.120 --> 13:48.520
They seem quite capable.

283
13:48.520 --> 13:49.240
Who did you hear that from?

284
13:49.240 --> 13:51.640
Are they recruiting new colleagues for us?

285
13:55.000 --> 13:55.840
He didn't say.

286
13:56.600 --> 13:58.660
Then they're not recruiting people.

287
13:59.360 --> 14:00.720
They're replacing people.

288
14:00.720 --> 14:01.640
Don't talk nonsense.

289
14:01.640 --> 14:02.520
Are you crazy?

290
14:02.680 --> 14:04.920
We were all carefully selected by Lawyer Li,

291
14:04.920 --> 14:05.800
the elite.

292
14:05.920 --> 14:07.800
They can't replace us no matter what.

293
14:07.800 --> 14:09.260
You two weren't selected.

294
14:09.360 --> 14:10.320
Not selected?

295
14:11.120 --> 14:12.320
Drawn by lots?

296
14:12.680 --> 14:13.340
Leftovers.

297
14:13.720 --> 14:14.600
Leftovers?

298
14:15.080 --> 14:16.610
Lawyer Li was late that day.

299
14:16.840 --> 14:18.300
Everyone else was picked.

300
14:18.400 --> 14:19.660
Only you two were left.

301
14:21.160 --> 14:22.890
Then this isn't a dinner party.

302
14:24.080 --> 14:25.740
Isn't this a farewell dinner?

303
15:00.320 --> 15:02.920
A mosquito bit me under my thigh. It's so itchy.

304
15:03.560 --> 15:05.820
There are too many mosquitoes in summer.

305
15:09.960 --> 15:11.280
Get some more sleep, Brother Jun.

306
15:11.280 --> 15:12.560
I'll wake you up when we arrive.

307
15:12.560 --> 15:13.080
No.

308
15:13.080 --> 15:14.720
I really have a big bump here.

309
15:14.720 --> 15:15.640
Yes, no, I...

310
15:15.640 --> 15:16.360
Look. Look.

311
15:24.840 --> 15:26.200
I'm not bullying you.

312
15:26.600 --> 15:27.960
The whole village is my relatives.

313
15:27.960 --> 15:28.880
Right, right, right.

314
15:28.880 --> 15:30.280
Get out. Get out.

315
15:30.280 --> 15:31.480
What are you yelling about?

316
15:31.480 --> 15:33.520
A life for a life is perfectly justified.

317
15:33.520 --> 15:35.120
Don't think you can buy a life with money.

318
15:35.120 --> 15:35.520
Exactly.

319
15:35.520 --> 15:36.160
You know?

320
15:36.160 --> 15:37.640
Money won't work.

321
15:37.920 --> 15:40.000
It's not for outsiders to meddle in our family's business.

322
15:40.000 --> 15:41.320
Don't move. Don't move.

323
15:41.320 --> 15:42.650
Don't move. Don't move.

324
15:43.080 --> 15:44.320
Alright. Are you rebelling?

325
15:44.320 --> 15:45.380
Alright. Alright.

326
15:45.400 --> 15:45.760
Alright.

327
15:45.760 --> 15:46.760
Listen to me.

328
15:48.720 --> 15:49.240
Let's not be impulsive.

329
15:49.240 --> 15:50.700
Can't we just talk nicely?

330
15:50.720 --> 15:52.120
It's not worth it at your age.

331
15:52.120 --> 15:55.000
You're the young man who came with the lawyer last time, right?

332
15:55.000 --> 15:55.720
What do you want to do?

333
15:55.720 --> 15:56.440
Who are you trying to scare?

334
15:56.440 --> 15:57.200
Trying to raise the price?

335
15:57.200 --> 15:58.520
Get out.

336
15:58.760 --> 15:59.490
Dare to move?

337
15:59.800 --> 16:00.640
Come on, make a move.

338
16:00.640 --> 16:01.280
Stop arguing.

339
16:01.280 --> 16:02.320
No, stop arguing.

340
16:03.360 --> 16:04.520
Alright, alright.

341
16:11.360 --> 16:13.160
Touch my brother again. Just try it.

342
16:13.160 --> 16:13.960
Stop it.

343
16:16.320 --> 16:18.040
Xiao Jun, Xiao Jun.

344
16:18.120 --> 16:18.920
Stop it.

345
16:21.040 --> 16:22.370
What are you doing here?

346
16:22.640 --> 16:23.900
Are you guys together?

347
16:24.000 --> 16:26.000
About the compensation issue,

348
16:26.000 --> 16:27.480
they just don't understand.

349
16:27.480 --> 16:29.200
It's fine. I'll take them away now.

350
16:29.200 --> 16:30.000
Sorry.

351
16:30.000 --> 16:30.480
Let's go.

352
16:30.480 --> 16:32.000
What compensation?

353
16:34.240 --> 16:34.770
Brother.

354
16:35.720 --> 16:38.520
Don't think we country folks don't know the law.

355
16:38.520 --> 16:41.040
The lawyer we hired has seen Xiaochen.

356
16:41.040 --> 16:43.240
He said Xiaochen works hard

357
16:43.240 --> 16:44.280
at the auto repair shop.

358
16:44.280 --> 16:46.040
It's Zhao Deqing's fault.

359
16:46.040 --> 16:49.000
Our Xiaochen acted in self-defense.

360
16:49.000 --> 16:50.440
It's not a crime at all.

361
16:50.440 --> 16:52.160
And we definitely won't pay compensation.

362
16:52.160 --> 16:53.220
Do you understand?

363
16:53.440 --> 16:54.360
The lawyer said so.

364
16:54.360 --> 16:55.890
Right, Lawyer Qian said so.

365
16:56.000 --> 16:57.360
Don't talk nonsense here.

366
16:57.360 --> 16:58.400
If murder is not a crime,

367
16:58.400 --> 16:59.160
then I am not guilty today.

368
16:59.160 --> 17:00.200
Stop spreading rumors here.

369
17:00.200 --> 17:01.530
You are guilty. Stop it.

370
17:01.680 --> 17:02.080
Stop it. Come on.

371
17:02.080 --> 17:05.079
The police are here. The police are here.

372
17:06.280 --> 17:07.000
Stop.

373
17:07.359 --> 17:08.890
It's a society ruled by law.

374
17:09.000 --> 17:10.660
I've recorded all your faces.

375
17:10.680 --> 17:12.280
Who hit whom, how they hit,

376
17:12.280 --> 17:13.520
and what they used.

377
17:13.520 --> 17:14.720
I've recorded it all.

378
17:14.720 --> 17:17.640
These videos will be handed over to the police as evidence.

379
17:17.640 --> 17:19.000
Then you'll compensate as required

380
17:19.000 --> 17:20.400
and be sentenced accordingly.

381
17:20.400 --> 17:21.280
Understand?

382
17:21.640 --> 17:22.170
Let's go.

383
17:22.280 --> 17:24.940
Let's go. Are you waiting for a banquet? Go home.

384
17:26.760 --> 17:27.890
Don't be impulsive.

385
17:28.319 --> 17:28.880
Let's go.

386
17:30.040 --> 17:31.520
It has nothing to do with me.

387
17:31.520 --> 17:33.160
Get in the car. Get in the car.

388
17:39.000 --> 17:40.400
[Sister Pang's Laundry]

389
17:40.640 --> 17:42.760
Was the guy with Xiaolong just now

390
17:43.480 --> 17:44.540
Director Li's son?

391
17:45.520 --> 17:46.920
He looks quite handsome.

392
17:47.000 --> 17:48.040
Absolutely.

393
17:48.440 --> 17:49.480
He's a fine-looking young man.

394
17:49.480 --> 17:50.040
Yeah.

395
17:50.600 --> 17:52.400
He's a good match for our Xiaolong, isn't he?

396
17:52.400 --> 17:53.240
For sure.

397
17:53.320 --> 17:55.400
Look at the car he drives.

398
17:56.240 --> 17:57.240
A Mercedes-Benz.

399
17:57.520 --> 17:59.920
Do you know there's an excellent quality called keeping a low profile?

400
17:59.920 --> 18:00.920
Give me a break.

401
18:00.920 --> 18:02.520
What's so great about driving an automatic?

402
18:02.520 --> 18:03.680
My manual transmission

403
18:03.680 --> 18:06.080
is a man's ultimate control over a machine.

404
18:06.400 --> 18:07.800
Give it a rest.

405
18:08.040 --> 18:10.280
If you really like controlling machines,

406
18:10.280 --> 18:13.280
why don't you go tinker with machine tools in a factory?

407
18:13.280 --> 18:14.360
Exactly.

408
18:14.520 --> 18:16.040
He can afford to drive a nice car.

409
18:16.040 --> 18:17.240
Intentionally not driving it,

410
18:17.240 --> 18:18.900
that's what you call low-key.

411
18:19.160 --> 18:21.000
He's just talking nonsense.

412
18:21.000 --> 18:22.280
If you're poor, just admit it.

413
18:22.280 --> 18:23.040
Right.

414
18:26.160 --> 18:26.760
Are you trying to murder us?

415
18:26.760 --> 18:27.760
What the hell are you doing?

416
18:27.760 --> 18:28.240
Did you do that on purpose?

417
18:28.240 --> 18:28.760
No, no.

418
18:28.760 --> 18:30.760
Look at you guys, you're over 200 years old combined.

419
18:30.760 --> 18:31.640
Why so suspicious?

420
18:31.640 --> 18:33.300
There's a pothole on the road.

421
18:44.400 --> 18:46.160
Why did you go make such a scene?

422
18:46.160 --> 18:47.600
What good did it do?

423
18:47.600 --> 18:48.880
I served as a warning.

424
18:49.240 --> 18:50.160
I let them know that from now on,

425
18:50.160 --> 18:52.040
they shouldn't dream of settling things with money.

426
18:52.040 --> 18:53.520
And what's this about self-defense?

427
18:53.520 --> 18:54.360
That was intentional homicide.

428
18:54.360 --> 18:55.840
Do you even know what intentional homicide

429
18:55.840 --> 18:56.920
or self-defense is?

430
18:56.920 --> 18:58.120
You just say whatever comes to mind.

431
18:58.120 --> 18:59.720
How old are you, Dad?

432
18:59.720 --> 19:01.240
Still fighting and killing?

433
19:01.240 --> 19:02.720
Didn't you tell me

434
19:02.920 --> 19:05.120
that the underworld is about worldly wisdom,

435
19:05.120 --> 19:06.160
not fighting and killing?

436
19:06.160 --> 19:07.160
What were you doing just now?

437
19:07.160 --> 19:08.120
Who were you going to kill or beat up?

438
19:08.120 --> 19:08.880
There was no fight.

439
19:08.880 --> 19:10.480
What do you mean? Just drive.

440
19:11.080 --> 19:13.840
Besides, I don't know what kind of person Fu Xiaochen is,

441
19:13.840 --> 19:16.320
but we both know what Uncle Daqing is like.

442
19:17.160 --> 19:18.920
Would you have gone back to prison if it weren't for him?

443
19:18.920 --> 19:21.080
Xiaolong, your Uncle Daqing has changed for the better.

444
19:21.080 --> 19:21.920
How do you know?

445
19:21.920 --> 19:22.960
You haven't contacted each other for over ten years.

446
19:22.960 --> 19:24.240
Did he tell you in a dream?

447
19:24.240 --> 19:26.160
You're just prejudiced against Uncle Daqing.

448
19:26.160 --> 19:27.440
Do you even know him?

449
19:27.640 --> 19:29.160
He was a brother who would risk his life for me.

450
19:29.160 --> 19:30.400
Do you know how hard it hit me

451
19:30.400 --> 19:31.640
now that he's gone?

452
19:35.880 --> 19:37.200
You didn't say a single word of comfort to me.

453
19:37.200 --> 19:38.400
That doesn't matter.

454
19:38.480 --> 19:40.280
But can't you at least try

455
19:40.280 --> 19:41.480
to put yourself in my shoes?

456
19:41.480 --> 19:43.480
How am I not putting myself in your shoes?

457
19:43.480 --> 19:44.160
What else do you want me to think?

458
19:44.160 --> 19:46.280
What do you think I'm working so hard for every day?

459
19:46.280 --> 19:47.240
Brothers who would risk their lives?

460
19:47.240 --> 19:48.720
Those brothers of yours,

461
19:48.720 --> 19:50.320
especially Uncle Daqing...

462
19:51.040 --> 19:51.880
That's enough.

463
19:51.880 --> 19:52.640
Don't stop halfway.

464
19:52.640 --> 19:53.400
He's gone now.

465
19:53.400 --> 19:54.160
Say whatever you want.

466
19:54.160 --> 19:54.920
Spit it out.

467
19:56.520 --> 19:57.920
I'm not saying anything.

468
20:01.280 --> 20:02.640
When I get killed by someone one day,

469
20:02.640 --> 20:03.400
you can also issue a letter of forgiveness.

470
20:03.400 --> 20:05.000
Just sell me for a good price.

471
20:27.680 --> 20:28.920
Thank you for today.

472
20:31.760 --> 20:34.760
But I feel that your emotions towards Zhao Deqing

473
20:35.040 --> 20:35.880
have, to some extent,

474
20:35.880 --> 20:37.940
affected your judgment on this case.

475
20:39.400 --> 20:40.720
How was I affected?

476
20:41.080 --> 20:43.760
Lady Justice holds a sword and scales.

477
20:44.800 --> 20:47.000
But why is she also wearing a blindfold?

478
20:50.600 --> 20:51.280
Of course.

479
20:51.280 --> 20:54.240
Outside of my professional scope, I understand you.

480
20:54.640 --> 20:55.280
Okay.

481
20:55.960 --> 20:57.640
The impartial Lawyer Li

482
20:57.640 --> 20:59.570
is starting to understand people.

483
21:00.440 --> 21:01.520
Okay, thank you.

484
21:02.000 --> 21:03.530
Go back. I'm going back too.

485
21:03.960 --> 21:04.820
Go to bed early.

486
21:05.760 --> 21:06.360
Okay.

487
21:34.720 --> 21:36.200
Long, come eat.

488
21:36.400 --> 21:37.160
Okay.

489
21:37.840 --> 21:38.920
Come on. No, no.

490
21:39.040 --> 21:40.400
There's no rush. Let's eat first.

491
21:40.400 --> 21:41.680
Word by word.

492
21:41.800 --> 21:44.060
Hurry up. Eat this to nourish your brain.

493
21:44.280 --> 21:45.160
What is this?

494
21:45.600 --> 21:46.520
Braised pig brain.

495
21:46.520 --> 21:48.920
Are you sure you want to use pig brain to nourish a human brain?

496
21:48.920 --> 21:50.050
You are what you eat.

497
21:50.880 --> 21:51.800
Then you should nourish yours first.

498
21:51.800 --> 21:52.280
Hurry up.

499
21:52.280 --> 21:53.520
Eat it.

500
22:00.640 --> 22:01.970
Why does it taste so bad?

501
22:02.480 --> 22:03.640
I followed the recipe exactly.

502
22:03.640 --> 22:05.400
That's a recipe for disaster.

503
22:05.640 --> 22:06.240
I've lost my touch.

504
22:06.240 --> 22:06.720
Don't.

505
22:06.720 --> 22:07.760
Eat this instead. Come on.

506
22:07.760 --> 22:08.240
Okay, let's eat this.

507
22:08.240 --> 22:08.970
This is good.

508
22:14.920 --> 22:16.720
I have your brother Zhao Deqing.

509
22:16.960 --> 22:18.360
Come over and let's talk.

510
22:20.520 --> 22:22.000
I'll only wait for you until six.

511
22:22.000 --> 22:23.260
I won't wait past that.

512
22:23.480 --> 22:24.540
You name the place.

513
22:37.040 --> 22:38.970
What are you doing? This is Daqing.

514
22:39.880 --> 22:41.320
Why the sack?

515
22:41.800 --> 22:43.400
Take the sack off. Let me see.

516
22:50.760 --> 22:51.640
Last time at the KTV,

517
22:51.640 --> 22:52.770
you ran pretty fast.

518
22:53.000 --> 22:54.200
Enemies often cross paths.

519
22:54.200 --> 22:56.130
You fell into my hands again today.

520
22:57.760 --> 23:01.160
Today we'll settle both old and new scores.

521
23:01.200 --> 23:03.160
Alright, you're done beating him, right?

522
23:03.160 --> 23:04.840
Since you're done, I'll just take him away.

523
23:04.840 --> 23:06.770
You're just going to take him away?

524
23:07.000 --> 23:08.530
If you can't teach him well,

525
23:09.120 --> 23:10.520
I'll teach him for you.

526
23:11.440 --> 23:13.240
Come, cut his Achilles tendons.

527
23:13.800 --> 23:14.600
Wait, wait.

528
23:16.240 --> 23:17.760
No, why did you call me here?

529
23:17.760 --> 23:18.840
Wasn't it to talk?

530
23:19.360 --> 23:20.400
Just tell me how much money you want.

531
23:20.400 --> 23:21.260
How much money?

532
23:22.360 --> 23:23.040
First,

533
23:24.800 --> 23:27.760
half of the Leyang freight line belongs to me from now on.

534
23:27.760 --> 23:28.760
You stay out of it.

535
23:29.360 --> 23:30.280
Fine, I'll give it to you.

536
23:30.280 --> 23:31.340
Straightforward.

537
23:31.560 --> 23:32.400
Second,

538
23:33.360 --> 23:36.820
when you smashed my head that day, the brothers were all there.

539
23:38.240 --> 23:39.760
How can I show my face?

540
23:41.360 --> 23:45.440
You didn't leash your dog well, so you have to take responsibility.

541
23:46.040 --> 23:47.840
Today, in front of the brothers,

542
23:49.280 --> 23:50.680
you will kneel before me.

543
23:52.760 --> 23:53.520
Whatever you do,

544
23:53.520 --> 23:55.040
don't go too far.

545
23:55.520 --> 23:57.120
Aren't you so loyal?

546
23:57.760 --> 23:59.690
You're the Eight Great Guardians?

547
24:03.720 --> 24:05.920
Cut both of his Achilles tendons for me.

548
24:06.760 --> 24:07.360
Alright, alright.

549
24:07.360 --> 24:08.280
I... I'll kneel.

550
24:08.280 --> 24:09.210
You can't kneel.

551
24:09.240 --> 24:10.040
Shut up.

552
24:10.640 --> 24:11.400
Let him go,

553
24:12.120 --> 24:13.720
then let my brother stand up,

554
24:14.080 --> 24:15.340
and I'll kneel for you.

555
24:20.400 --> 24:21.280
Come, stand up.

556
24:22.960 --> 24:24.280
Brother, you can't.

557
24:24.280 --> 24:24.880
Brother.

558
24:25.000 --> 24:25.800
Brother.

559
24:27.360 --> 24:28.160
Brother.

560
24:37.880 --> 24:38.600
Deqing.

561
25:29.240 --> 25:29.760
Come in.

562
25:30.440 --> 25:31.040
Lawyer Li,

563
25:31.760 --> 25:33.040
you've been working hard lately.

564
25:33.040 --> 25:35.840
I ordered your favorite iced Americano.

565
25:36.480 --> 25:37.280
Thank you,

566
25:37.760 --> 25:40.440
but I don't drink Americanos anymore.

567
25:42.760 --> 25:43.600
Understood.

568
25:43.960 --> 25:45.290
You have a new favorite.

569
25:45.440 --> 25:47.360
You fell in love with something else.

570
25:47.360 --> 25:48.760
I just don't understand.

571
25:48.840 --> 25:50.920
How can you just stop drinking it like that?

572
25:50.920 --> 25:52.920
So you just stop loving it like that?

573
25:52.920 --> 25:53.440
No.

574
25:54.200 --> 25:56.000
What did the Americano do wrong?

575
25:56.120 --> 25:57.640
Doesn't it taste good?

576
25:57.960 --> 25:59.760
The Americano is innocent!

577
26:00.120 --> 26:01.520
Are you okay, Americano?

578
26:03.200 --> 26:04.600
Do you have nothing to do?

579
26:07.360 --> 26:08.880
Well, nothing.

580
26:09.120 --> 26:10.250
Go back to your work.

581
26:10.520 --> 26:11.600
I empathized with it.

582
26:11.600 --> 26:12.240
Come on.

583
26:13.240 --> 26:16.200
If you have nothing to do, take the Americano away.

584
26:24.680 --> 26:26.480
Is it a crime not to drink coffee?

585
26:33.320 --> 26:34.240
He has changed.

586
26:44.080 --> 26:44.810
You're here.

587
26:45.800 --> 26:46.640
Have a seat.

588
26:48.000 --> 26:48.680
Well...

589
26:49.520 --> 26:51.960
Let me apologize to you first.

590
26:51.960 --> 26:53.960
I really didn't dare to skip it yesterday,

591
26:53.960 --> 26:56.120
so I didn't have time to tip you off.

592
26:56.640 --> 26:58.520
So, what do you want for lunch today?

593
26:58.520 --> 27:00.720
My treat. Order whatever you want. I...

594
27:01.600 --> 27:02.660
My treat. My treat.

595
27:03.600 --> 27:05.240
The miser is finally spending money.

596
27:05.240 --> 27:06.840
I'm usually pretty generous, aren't I?

597
27:06.840 --> 27:08.240
Order whatever you want.

598
27:10.760 --> 27:13.240
Alright, it's not entirely your fault.

599
27:13.440 --> 27:14.240
Indeed,

600
27:14.920 --> 27:17.320
there are some unclear points in this case.

601
27:18.600 --> 27:20.840
Jun really got through to you.

602
27:20.840 --> 27:22.440
How did he do it? I should learn from him.

603
27:22.440 --> 27:25.360
Do you know why Lady Justice wears a blindfold?

604
27:28.600 --> 27:30.060
She's afraid of the light.

605
27:30.200 --> 27:32.060
I'm really scared of you, really.

606
27:32.160 --> 27:33.960
To maintain impartiality.

607
27:34.880 --> 27:35.760
Uncle.

608
27:36.160 --> 27:37.560
Maintain impartiality.

609
27:37.880 --> 27:38.840
Jun is brilliant.

610
27:38.840 --> 27:39.500
Brilliant.

611
27:40.360 --> 27:41.040
Luo Zhi,

612
27:41.240 --> 27:42.600
how's the audit going?

613
27:43.760 --> 27:45.720
Miaomiao and I checked it carefully several times.

614
27:45.720 --> 27:47.200
Zhao Deqing's auto repair shop

615
27:47.200 --> 27:48.440
has been running for several years.

616
27:48.440 --> 27:50.120
There are more than 100,000 in the account.

617
27:50.120 --> 27:51.720
And his daily expenses are not much.

618
27:51.720 --> 27:53.250
He lives a very frugal life.

619
27:53.400 --> 27:55.960
Then why did Zhao Deqing attack Fu Xiaochen?

620
27:56.320 --> 27:57.960
Then we have to see if Fu Xiaochen

621
27:57.960 --> 27:59.560
was acting in self-defense.

622
27:59.720 --> 28:00.480
That's right.

623
28:00.480 --> 28:01.720
Should I let Jun know?

624
28:01.720 --> 28:02.760
Don't you dare.

625
28:02.760 --> 28:03.880
Then I won't.

626
28:04.760 --> 28:05.680
Zhao Deqing?

627
28:05.840 --> 28:07.600
He doesn't talk to any of the neighbors,

628
28:07.600 --> 28:08.920
and he looks fierce.

629
28:09.000 --> 28:11.000
How would I know anything about him?

630
28:11.600 --> 28:13.080
He beat and scolded Fu Xiaochen.

631
28:13.080 --> 28:15.280
Several of us neighbors saw it at the time.

632
28:15.280 --> 28:17.540
Zhao Deqing must have pushed him too far.

633
28:17.720 --> 28:20.160
When that young man was taken away by the police,

634
28:20.160 --> 28:21.640
He kept muttering,

635
28:21.640 --> 28:22.840
I didn't mean it.

636
28:22.920 --> 28:23.880
Didn't mean it.

637
28:24.200 --> 28:26.040
I heard it loud and clear.

638
28:31.200 --> 28:32.400
Hello? What's wrong?

639
28:33.920 --> 28:34.720
What?

640
28:35.520 --> 28:37.720
Filing a complaint against me to the Bar Association?

641
28:37.720 --> 28:39.000
Xiao Longnv's dad

642
28:39.360 --> 28:40.480
took a bunch of thugs

643
28:40.480 --> 28:43.200
to my client's house to threaten them.

644
28:43.280 --> 28:45.240
This is absolutely outrageous.

645
28:45.840 --> 28:48.400
I apologize to your client on behalf of my dad.

646
28:49.000 --> 28:49.840
After all,

647
28:49.840 --> 28:52.680
my dad and the victim have been friends for years.

648
28:53.200 --> 28:53.840
I'm sorry.

649
28:53.840 --> 28:55.640
Do you think a simple sorry is enough?

650
28:55.640 --> 28:56.440
Let me ask you,

651
28:56.480 --> 28:58.640
did you go to my client's house

652
28:58.640 --> 28:59.640
to ask his parents for money?

653
28:59.640 --> 29:01.100
I wasn't asking for money.

654
29:01.360 --> 29:04.680
I was negotiating compensation on behalf of the victim's family.

655
29:04.680 --> 29:06.360
What right do you have to negotiate compensation?

656
29:06.360 --> 29:07.840
Let me be clear.

657
29:07.840 --> 29:10.640
The Fu family won't pay a single cent.

658
29:10.840 --> 29:12.880
No, we are both lawyers.

659
29:12.880 --> 29:14.440
We should both know

660
29:14.440 --> 29:16.720
how important this letter of forgiveness is

661
29:16.720 --> 29:17.800
for Fu Xiaochen's sentence reduction.

662
29:17.800 --> 29:20.000
Shouldn't our goals be the same?

663
29:20.000 --> 29:21.720
What same goals?

664
29:22.040 --> 29:25.880
Zhao Deqing has been bullying and exploiting Fu Xiaochen.

665
29:26.400 --> 29:28.200
Fu Xiaochen worked for him.

666
29:28.200 --> 29:29.660
Not only did he not pay him,

667
29:29.720 --> 29:32.250
he also wanted the money he earned elsewhere.

668
29:32.280 --> 29:33.600
If he didn't give it, he'd get beaten.

669
29:33.600 --> 29:35.440
Fu Xiaochen couldn't take it anymore,

670
29:35.440 --> 29:36.720
so he had to fight back.

671
29:36.720 --> 29:38.600
That's called self-defense.

672
29:38.720 --> 29:39.440
And you,

673
29:40.040 --> 29:41.400
you asked for an exorbitant amount,

674
29:41.400 --> 29:43.480
trying to scam all his money.

675
29:44.120 --> 29:45.380
Who's scamming money?

676
29:45.480 --> 29:47.000
No, wait a minute.

677
29:47.280 --> 29:48.240
Did Fu Xiaochen tell you all this

678
29:48.240 --> 29:50.200
himself?

679
29:50.480 --> 29:52.040
Are you trying to trick me into a confession?

680
29:52.040 --> 29:54.640
The first instance of this case is in the Intermediate People's Court,

681
29:54.640 --> 29:57.640
which means it's a relatively serious criminal case.

682
29:57.640 --> 29:58.800
Fu Xiaochen is very likely

683
29:58.800 --> 30:01.130
to be sentenced to life in prison or death.

684
30:01.320 --> 30:03.640
Don't give me that nonsense.

685
30:03.640 --> 30:05.760
One of them is an ex-convict,

686
30:05.760 --> 30:08.640
and the other has been clean all his life.

687
30:08.640 --> 30:09.560
Who is more credible?

688
30:09.560 --> 30:11.040
Isn't it obvious?

689
30:11.040 --> 30:13.640
Since when do we judge cases based on criminal records?

690
30:13.640 --> 30:15.080
Are you a professional?

691
30:15.200 --> 30:16.240
I'm not a professional?

692
30:16.240 --> 30:17.600
I've been practicing law

693
30:17.600 --> 30:19.200
longer than you've been alive.

694
30:19.200 --> 30:20.000
Lawyers,

695
30:20.120 --> 30:21.000
calm down.

696
30:21.280 --> 30:22.640
Let's just solve the problem.

697
30:22.640 --> 30:24.400
Calm down, both of you.

698
30:24.600 --> 30:25.760
Yeah, calm down.

699
30:25.760 --> 30:27.160
I'm not angry at all.

700
30:27.160 --> 30:29.240
I don't know why they're so mad.

701
30:29.240 --> 30:30.370
What's the big deal?

702
30:32.880 --> 30:33.940
Xiaochen's uncle,

703
30:33.960 --> 30:35.040
if she harasses you again,

704
30:35.040 --> 30:36.160
just call me.

705
30:36.320 --> 30:37.240
As for Xiaochen's case,

706
30:37.240 --> 30:38.200
leave it to me.

707
30:38.200 --> 30:39.160
Don't worry.

708
30:39.360 --> 30:40.480
I guarantee there won't be any problems.

709
30:40.480 --> 30:42.480
I'll handle this perfectly for you.

710
30:42.600 --> 30:43.280
Sister Long.

711
30:43.280 --> 30:44.240
You're out.

712
30:44.400 --> 30:46.860
Is that the lawyer who complained about you?

713
30:47.880 --> 30:50.480
He looks like an enlarged version of the Beast.

714
30:51.000 --> 30:53.880
This Lawyer Qian is really a bit unreliable.

715
30:54.040 --> 30:55.960
Not only did he not seek forgiveness,

716
30:55.960 --> 30:58.620
but he also didn't let Fu Xiaochen plead guilty.

717
30:59.520 --> 31:01.120
Won't he get a heavy sentence then?

718
31:01.120 --> 31:03.240
I've seen many unscrupulous lawyers like him.

719
31:03.240 --> 31:05.280
He'll say anything just to make money.

720
31:05.280 --> 31:06.160
I guess he's just afraid

721
31:06.160 --> 31:07.280
that Fu Xiaochen's parents will pay the compensation,

722
31:07.280 --> 31:08.400
and he won't make any money.

723
31:08.400 --> 31:09.040
Director.

724
31:09.520 --> 31:11.320
I just got Zhao Deqing's call records.

725
31:11.320 --> 31:12.250
I looked closely

726
31:12.360 --> 31:14.800
and found that around the time Zhao Deqing was murdered,

727
31:14.800 --> 31:16.520
someone talked to him on the phone.

728
31:16.520 --> 31:18.600
And this number has appeared a few times before.

729
31:18.600 --> 31:18.800
Called number 15263.

730
31:18.760 --> 31:19.640
Called number 1526374.

731
31:18.760 --> 31:20.290
Called number 1872635489.

732
31:25.120 --> 31:26.040
Hello.

733
31:26.480 --> 31:28.680
I'm the lawyer representing Zhao Deqing's family.

734
31:28.680 --> 31:29.680
My surname is Xiao.

735
31:29.680 --> 31:32.080
I don't know him. You have the wrong number.

736
31:36.440 --> 31:38.400
There was a mechanic at Zhangjiadian

737
31:38.400 --> 31:39.720
who got killed recently.

738
31:39.720 --> 31:40.760
Did you guys know?

739
31:41.040 --> 31:41.440
I...

740
31:41.640 --> 31:43.240
He probably deserved it.

741
31:43.720 --> 31:44.880
I heard all about it.

742
31:45.400 --> 31:46.330
I don't think so.

743
31:49.840 --> 31:51.640
How do you know he deserved it when you don't even know what happened?

744
31:51.640 --> 31:53.600
The guy who got killed had been in prison before.

745
31:53.600 --> 31:55.200
How could he be a good person?

746
31:55.240 --> 31:56.440
It's karma.

747
31:56.440 --> 31:57.520
Stop talking nonsense.

748
31:57.520 --> 32:00.450
Keep your mouth shut if you don't know what happened.

749
32:00.800 --> 32:02.280
I wasn't talking about you.

750
32:02.280 --> 32:03.680
Why are you so mad?

751
32:03.960 --> 32:05.160
I know you and the dead guy

752
32:05.160 --> 32:06.640
came out of the same cell.

753
32:06.640 --> 32:09.640
People like you should keep a low profile.

754
32:09.720 --> 32:12.720
Otherwise, you're just social scum even when you die.

755
32:14.920 --> 32:15.880
Stop fighting.

756
32:17.360 --> 32:19.160
Stop it.

757
32:19.920 --> 32:20.840
About this matter,

758
32:20.840 --> 32:23.100
you guys should go back and think it over.

759
32:23.160 --> 32:24.290
Come back next time.

760
32:24.400 --> 32:25.680
If mediation fails again,

761
32:25.680 --> 32:27.400
we'll handle it by the book.

762
32:27.520 --> 32:28.160
Okay.

763
32:28.880 --> 32:30.140
Sorry for the trouble.

764
32:30.720 --> 32:31.560
Will do.

765
32:32.320 --> 32:32.960
Thank you.

766
32:32.960 --> 32:34.320
So what if you have a lawyer?

767
32:34.320 --> 32:36.200
I'll get one too and sue you to death.

768
32:36.200 --> 32:37.160
Of course you can.

769
32:37.160 --> 32:38.320
But let me give you a piece of advice.

770
32:38.320 --> 32:40.120
Legally, this is considered a mutual fight.

771
32:40.120 --> 32:41.720
If you keep holding onto this,

772
32:41.720 --> 32:43.400
you might face administrative detention.

773
32:43.400 --> 32:44.440
Then detain me.

774
32:44.600 --> 32:45.130
Alright.

775
32:45.680 --> 32:47.840
Mr. Xiao has already decided to quit his job.

776
32:47.840 --> 32:48.600
What?

777
32:48.760 --> 32:49.960
Are you planning to quit your job

778
32:49.960 --> 32:51.620
and keep him company in there?

779
32:56.960 --> 32:57.620
This act...

780
32:58.320 --> 32:59.920
I held back when I hit him.

781
32:59.920 --> 33:01.320
Otherwise, he would have been in the hospital.

782
33:01.320 --> 33:02.840
If he really went to the hospital,

783
33:02.840 --> 33:04.320
you wouldn't be standing here.

784
33:04.320 --> 33:04.920
Let's go.

785
33:05.360 --> 33:07.690
You're too old to be fighting all the time.

786
33:08.920 --> 33:09.680
Xiaoxin,

787
33:10.080 --> 33:11.080
thank you.

788
33:12.160 --> 33:13.220
This godfather...

789
33:15.160 --> 33:16.400
Why is there a door god here?

790
33:16.400 --> 33:17.960
Why did you bring your dad here?

791
33:17.960 --> 33:19.200
Let's go, Godfather.

792
33:20.880 --> 33:21.640
Thanks for your hard work.

793
33:21.640 --> 33:23.240
I'll leave Godfather to you.

794
33:24.600 --> 33:26.800
Are you two handing over a prisoner?

795
33:26.800 --> 33:28.730
Doing a point-to-point handover?

796
33:30.800 --> 33:32.080
I... I'll open the door.

797
33:32.080 --> 33:32.680
Open it.

798
33:37.480 --> 33:38.880
What are you doing?

799
33:38.880 --> 33:39.480
Go in.

800
33:57.680 --> 33:59.560
No, you don't have to stay here with me.

801
33:59.560 --> 34:00.960
Look how old I am.

802
34:00.960 --> 34:01.680
Where else can I go?

803
34:01.680 --> 34:02.680
What else can I do?

804
34:03.320 --> 34:03.920
You... you should...

805
34:03.920 --> 34:05.980
Shouldn't you go home and take a look?

806
34:12.120 --> 34:13.159
Report, officer.

807
34:13.400 --> 34:14.199
What is it now?

808
34:14.320 --> 34:14.920
I'm hungry.

809
34:14.920 --> 34:15.800
I need to eat.

810
34:15.800 --> 34:18.080
I can't afford to waste time with you, you know?

811
34:18.080 --> 34:19.600
I... you... you...

812
34:19.600 --> 34:21.800
Staying here is really... honestly...

813
34:29.120 --> 34:29.880
I...

814
34:30.679 --> 34:32.679
Why do I have to eat instant noodles?

815
34:32.840 --> 34:33.679
Just make do with it.

816
34:33.679 --> 34:35.880
Eating instant noodles all the time is bad for my health.

817
34:35.880 --> 34:36.400
I want to cook.

818
34:36.400 --> 34:38.130
I want to stir-fry some dishes.

819
34:39.159 --> 34:40.679
If you want to cook, we have to do it together.

820
34:40.679 --> 34:41.400
Alright, alright.

821
34:41.400 --> 34:42.600
Let's do it together.

822
34:42.679 --> 34:44.409
Let me tell you what dish... no.

823
34:44.600 --> 34:46.199
The food is over there, look.

824
34:48.239 --> 34:48.960
Xiao Jun,

825
34:49.760 --> 34:50.760
open the door for me.

826
34:50.760 --> 34:52.159
Xiao Jun, open the door.

827
34:52.760 --> 34:53.889
Open the door for me.

828
34:55.400 --> 34:56.239
Open it for me.

829
34:56.239 --> 34:58.240
Open the door for me.

830
34:59.240 --> 35:00.600
I'll count to three.

831
35:01.120 --> 35:01.880
Xiao Jun.

832
35:24.640 --> 35:25.960
Don't worry, Dad Li.

833
35:25.960 --> 35:27.000
I found him.

834
35:33.720 --> 35:34.320
Pause.

835
35:37.120 --> 35:37.920
What is this?

836
35:38.560 --> 35:39.880
Zoom in a little more.

837
35:40.920 --> 35:41.850
What does it say?

838
35:42.120 --> 35:42.680
Bai...

839
35:42.760 --> 35:43.720
Baihe.

840
35:43.920 --> 35:44.920
Baihe Hair Salon.

841
35:48.040 --> 35:49.120
Baihe.

842
35:51.920 --> 35:52.720
The haircutting skills

843
35:52.720 --> 35:53.560
are really good.

844
35:53.560 --> 35:54.680
Isn't this the phone number

845
35:54.680 --> 35:56.480
from Zhao Deqing's last call?

846
36:03.280 --> 36:04.880
Is your name Zheng Xiaohong?

847
36:06.280 --> 36:08.480
You left this fingerprint, didn't you?

848
36:09.280 --> 36:10.520
Do I have to get a forensic appraisal

849
36:10.520 --> 36:11.840
before you admit it?

850
36:12.280 --> 36:13.840
I don't mean anything else.

851
36:13.840 --> 36:14.880
Just tell me,

852
36:14.880 --> 36:17.200
what's your relationship with Zhao Deqing?

853
36:17.200 --> 36:18.960
My child needs to eat.

854
36:19.200 --> 36:20.720
Please leave.

855
36:21.400 --> 36:22.000
No, don't.

856
36:22.000 --> 36:23.120
Leave. Tell me.

857
36:23.280 --> 36:24.320
Leave.

858
36:24.800 --> 36:25.200
You...

859
36:25.920 --> 36:28.120
If you pull me again, I'm telling you...

860
36:28.320 --> 36:29.880
What exactly do you want?

861
36:30.080 --> 36:32.520
I told you I don't know any Zhao Deqing.

862
36:33.120 --> 36:33.880
What's wrong with you?

863
36:33.880 --> 36:35.320
Are you going to stab me?

864
36:36.240 --> 36:37.040
My God, she...

865
36:39.240 --> 36:40.500
What's wrong with you?

866
36:42.240 --> 36:43.000
Are you trying to kill someone?

867
36:43.000 --> 36:43.800
Xiao Jun.

868
36:44.080 --> 36:44.560
You...

869
36:46.240 --> 36:47.300
What are you doing?

870
36:48.080 --> 36:49.540
You even brought a weapon.

871
36:49.760 --> 36:50.560
What are you doing?

872
36:50.560 --> 36:52.120
I...

873
36:52.440 --> 36:53.880
The scissors were in her hand just now.

874
36:53.880 --> 36:54.920
She was going to stab me.

875
36:54.920 --> 36:56.380
I wasn't going to stab her.

876
36:57.920 --> 36:59.240
Let the child speak.

877
36:59.240 --> 37:01.370
Weren't they in her hand just now? I...

878
37:04.440 --> 37:05.280
That's enough.

879
37:05.280 --> 37:06.680
Come with me, Jun.

880
37:07.120 --> 37:07.880
How embarrassing.

881
37:07.880 --> 37:09.880
You're holding scissors and you...

882
37:10.080 --> 37:10.880
No, no, no.

883
37:11.240 --> 37:12.360
Stop it.

884
37:12.360 --> 37:13.760
People are scared of you.

885
37:14.440 --> 37:15.080
Um...

886
37:16.600 --> 37:17.520
I'm sorry.

887
37:31.320 --> 37:33.000
Actually, I saw you that day

888
37:33.240 --> 37:34.570
at the auto repair shop.

889
37:34.880 --> 37:36.540
You were wearing blue, right?

890
37:42.160 --> 37:43.820
Our investigation found that

891
37:43.880 --> 37:45.080
when Zhao Deqing's incident happened,

892
37:45.080 --> 37:46.740
you were on the phone with him.

893
37:46.760 --> 37:48.560
So we just wanted to come and ask.

894
37:50.600 --> 37:53.000
I really didn't hear anything on that call.

895
37:53.560 --> 37:55.290
There was no signal at the time.

896
37:55.320 --> 37:56.800
I already told the police.

897
37:56.920 --> 37:58.840
Don't worry. Even if you heard something,

898
37:58.840 --> 38:01.840
it absolutely won't affect you. Really.

899
38:07.000 --> 38:09.200
If there's nothing else, please leave.

900
38:15.360 --> 38:16.520
What did I say?

901
38:16.680 --> 38:17.920
I told him he was that kind of person,

902
38:17.920 --> 38:19.240
but my dad wouldn't believe it.

903
38:19.240 --> 38:20.440
He insisted I investigate.

904
38:20.440 --> 38:22.840
What could I possibly find out? Seriously.

905
38:24.800 --> 38:26.530
Sister, don't misunderstand.

906
38:26.840 --> 38:28.170
That was my dad just now.

907
38:28.360 --> 38:30.920
He and Zhao Deqing were sworn brothers.

908
38:31.080 --> 38:32.400
They even went to prison together

909
38:32.400 --> 38:33.800
and roamed the world together.

910
38:33.800 --> 38:35.240
Now that he knows Uncle Deqing is gone,

911
38:35.240 --> 38:36.440
he really can't take it.

912
38:36.440 --> 38:38.000
So he insisted I come over to investigate,

913
38:38.000 --> 38:39.440
saying he just wants the truth.

914
38:39.440 --> 38:41.320
Don't I know Uncle Deqing?

915
38:41.560 --> 38:43.320
He's fighting and killing every day,

916
38:43.320 --> 38:45.160
stabbing someone or hitting another.

917
38:45.160 --> 38:47.360
Even his own sister knows what kind of person he is.

918
38:47.360 --> 38:49.360
The truth is he deserved it.

919
38:49.560 --> 38:50.680
To put it bluntly,

920
38:50.680 --> 38:52.160
Uncle Deqing ending up like this

921
38:52.160 --> 38:53.800
is just heaven punishing the wicked.

922
38:53.800 --> 38:55.240
He deserved to be stabbed.

923
38:55.240 --> 38:56.640
Sister, don't you agree?

924
38:58.280 --> 38:59.280
What's there to investigate?

925
38:59.280 --> 39:00.480
Okay, that's it.

926
39:01.840 --> 39:03.120
It's not like that.

927
39:09.200 --> 39:11.330
Zhao Deqing is not that kind of person.

928
39:22.080 --> 39:23.760
I only met Daqing

929
39:24.320 --> 39:25.840
because of Fu Xiaochen.

930
39:34.480 --> 39:36.200
Um, hello.

931
39:37.320 --> 39:38.640
Is this bag yours?

932
39:42.760 --> 39:43.480
Take a look

933
39:43.760 --> 39:45.490
and see if anything is missing.

934
39:58.280 --> 39:59.000
Well,

935
40:00.880 --> 40:02.540
could you not call the police?

936
40:02.680 --> 40:04.560
It's the kid's first time doing such a shameful thing.

937
40:04.560 --> 40:05.890
Just spare him this once

938
40:05.920 --> 40:08.580
and give him a chance to be a decent person, okay?

939
40:13.000 --> 40:13.760
Thank you.

940
40:16.880 --> 40:17.560
Wait.

941
40:20.920 --> 40:21.920
What else?

942
40:23.560 --> 40:26.400
Since you helped me get this bag back,

943
40:27.800 --> 40:29.600
let me trim your hair for you.

944
40:41.200 --> 40:42.400
Is this your child?

945
40:44.360 --> 40:45.960
What's wrong with the child?

946
40:49.440 --> 40:50.770
Prenatal brain damage.

947
40:51.120 --> 40:52.320
He was born like this.

948
40:55.160 --> 40:56.840
He heard that the child's father

949
40:56.840 --> 40:58.640
ran away right after he was born.

950
40:59.400 --> 41:00.360
Since then,

951
41:00.560 --> 41:01.880
he's been coming over every now and then

952
41:01.880 --> 41:03.960
to bring us some food and drinks.

953
41:05.480 --> 41:06.080
Xiaohong.

954
41:06.600 --> 41:07.480
I'm here.

955
41:08.000 --> 41:09.000
Here, some stuff.

956
41:09.880 --> 41:10.920
Where's the child?

957
41:10.920 --> 41:11.800
Asleep.

958
41:13.600 --> 41:15.920
Brother, don't trouble yourself.

959
41:16.120 --> 41:17.280
You haven't eaten yet, right?

960
41:17.280 --> 41:18.800
I just cooked some noodles.

961
41:18.800 --> 41:20.200
Come, eat while it's hot.

962
41:31.880 --> 41:32.760
Daqing.

963
41:34.520 --> 41:36.180
I've always wanted to ask you,

964
41:36.560 --> 41:38.920
about the scar on your face.

965
41:40.200 --> 41:41.460
It wasn't from a fight.

966
41:42.360 --> 41:44.960
When I was driving a truck back then,

967
41:45.600 --> 41:47.880
I almost died in a crash.

968
41:48.240 --> 41:50.080
The truck was completely totaled.

969
41:50.080 --> 41:51.480
I was knocked dizzy at the time,

970
41:51.480 --> 41:52.480
covered in blood.

971
41:53.000 --> 41:54.400
A sworn brother of mine

972
41:55.680 --> 41:58.200
ran all the way to the hospital with me on his back,

973
41:58.200 --> 41:59.240
and saved my life.

974
42:00.720 --> 42:02.980
A step later and I would have met my maker.

975
42:03.600 --> 42:05.000
Later, this brother of mine

976
42:05.000 --> 42:06.330
got the guys in the fleet

977
42:06.560 --> 42:08.360
to chip in and buy me a used truck.

978
42:09.720 --> 42:11.720
I continued to haul goods with them.

979
42:12.240 --> 42:13.480
It was only later that I found out

980
42:13.480 --> 42:14.520
that the money for the truck,

981
42:14.520 --> 42:16.980
more than half of it was paid by that brother.

982
42:18.080 --> 42:20.810
I owe him a debt I can never repay in this lifetime.

983
42:23.080 --> 42:25.240
Once, when we didn't have enough for the child's medical bills,

984
42:25.240 --> 42:27.440
he even helped by fronting 20,000 yuan.

985
42:27.920 --> 42:29.580
He absolutely refused an IOU.

986
42:29.760 --> 42:31.520
As for the IOU you saw,

987
42:31.560 --> 42:33.820
I secretly slipped it into his notebook.

988
42:34.480 --> 42:36.320
The time I went to deliver the IOU,

989
42:36.320 --> 42:39.800
I even saw Brother Daqing teaching Fu Xiaochen how to fix cars.

990
42:39.800 --> 42:41.400
Uncle, this is too hard.

991
42:41.720 --> 42:42.720
What isn't hard?

992
42:43.200 --> 42:45.320
You're a young man with no diploma.

993
42:45.400 --> 42:46.280
If you don't learn a skill,

994
42:46.280 --> 42:48.040
how will you support yourself in the future?

995
42:48.040 --> 42:51.570
Then how did they end up like this when they were perfectly fine?

996
42:52.440 --> 42:56.720
Then, what exactly did you hear on that phone call?
